   170	|---|---:|---:|---|
   171	| bare | 0/0 | 4 HTTP-403 errors | blocked before scoring |
   172	| structural hint | 0/0 | 4 HTTP-403 errors | blocked before scoring |
   173	| placebo hint | 0/0 | 4 HTTP-403 errors | blocked before scoring |
