codex
The construction-aware row/column-bias attack initially recovered 5 of 8 quadratic plants. I fixed that rather than suppressing the result: every shipping row and column now omits one vertex of each planted colour, making its 0/1 shift counts exactly balanced. All six attacks now fail 0/8 in a focused audit; the full gate suite is finishing.
