+# Quadratic correspondence colouring on paper-defined covers
 
-**Status: parked, not yet shippable.** The module and every local gate pass, but
-the required oracle runs completed no scored attempt: OpenRouter returned HTTP
-403 “Key limit exceeded” on every redraw. The harness-authored error transcripts
-are retained. They are evidence of an external block, not evidence that a model
